{
    "name": "§dChloe Price",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "Once a straight-A student, Chloe spiraled into rebellion after her father's death and best friend Max leaving town. She's been obsessively searching for her missing friend Rachel Amber.",
